OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785111491
OL,3,CStudy indicates how much home buyers
OL,4,Ccould save by picking less pricey
OL,5,Cpostcodes
OL,7,FLocation may be firmly at the top of
OL,8,Fmany home buyers' minds ` but those
OL,9,Fsearching for a property could
OL,10,Fpotentially save significant sums by
OL,11,Flooking next door to pricey postcodes
OL,12,F` according to a major bank.
OL,14,FLloyds compared higher value postcodes
OL,15,Fin different parts of the UK with what
OL,16,Fit found to be the least costly
OL,17,Fneighbouring postcodes sitting next to
OL,18,Fthem.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785111491
OL,3,CStudy indicates how much home buyers
OL,4,Ccould save by picking less pricey
OL,5,Cpostcodes
OL,7,FAccording to Lloyds' analysis, homes
OL,8,Fin these neighbouring areas cost 28%
OL,9,Fless on average, but in many places
OL,10,Fthe gap is significantly wider.
OL,12,FIn the North East of England, Lloyds
OL,13,Ffound that in the postcode of NE26,
OL,14,Fencompassing the seaside town of
OL,15,FWhitley Bay, the average price was
OL,16,F#304,022.
OL,18,FNext door in NE24, which takes in the
OL,19,Ftown of Blyth, the average price of a
OL,20,Fhome was #162,075 ` #141,947 or 47%
OL,21,Fless than in neighbouring NE26.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785111491
OL,3,CStudy indicates how much home buyers
OL,4,Ccould save by picking less pricey
OL,5,Cpostcodes
OL,7,FAmanda Bryden, head of mortgages at
OL,8,FLloyds, said: "It's easy to focus on
OL,9,Fthe 'must-have' locations when you're
OL,10,Fsearching for a home, but this
OL,11,Fresearch highlights just how much
OL,12,Fvalue can sit right next door.
OL,14,F"Of course, neighbouring areas aren't
OL,15,Falways directly comparable and each
OL,16,Fwill have its own distinctive
OL,17,Fcharacter, housing stock and local
OL,18,Fappeal.
OL,26,@pD@OOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785111491
OL,3,CStudy indicates how much home buyers
OL,4,Ccould save by picking less pricey
OL,5,Cpostcodes
OL,7,F"But in many parts of the country,
OL,8,Flooking just beyond the most sought-
OL,9,Fafter postcodes can reveal more
OL,10,Faffordable options while still keeping
OL,11,Fbuyers close to jobs, transport links,
OL,12,Famenities and the communities that
OL,13,Fmatter to them.
OL,15,F"For first-time buyers in particular,
OL,16,Fa small shift in location could make a
OL,17,Fbig difference ` not just in getting
OL,18,Fon the ladder, but in what kind of
OL,19,Fproperty is within reach."
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOU{D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785111491
OL,3,CStudy indicates how much home buyers
OL,4,Ccould save by picking less pricey
OL,5,Cpostcodes
OL,7,FLloyds said that in London, NW3 is
OL,8,Famong the city's most expensive
OL,9,Fpostcodes, covering locations such as
OL,10,FHampstead and Belsize Park. The
OL,11,Faverage house price there was #778,767.
OL,13,FBut in neighbouring NW2, including
OL,14,Fareas such as Cricklewood and Dollis
OL,15,FHill, the average house price was
OL,16,F#546,348, buyers here could pay
OL,17,F#232,419 less compared to neighbouring
OL,18,FNW3 ` a saving of around 30%.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
