CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785111491
OL,3,CStudy indicates how much home buyers
OL,4,Ccould save by picking less pricey
OL,5,Cpostcodes
OL,7,FIn Scotland, the EH3 postcode,
OL,8,Fcovering central Edinburgh, including
OL,9,Fthe West End, had an average house
OL,10,Fprice of #374,650.
OL,12,FNeighbouring EH11, covering areas such
OL,13,Fas Gorgie and Stenhouse, had an
OL,14,Faverage house price of #299,315 ` a
OL,15,Fpotential saving of #75,335 or 20%
OL,16,Fcompared with the EH3 postcode.
OL,18,FIn Wales, the average house price in
OL,19,FCF64, which covers Penarth, Dinas
OL,20,FPowys and Sully, had an average house
OL,21,Fprice of #342,753.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
