OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785111491
OL,3,CStudy indicates how much home buyers
OL,4,Ccould save by picking less pricey
OL,5,Cpostcodes
OL,7,FJust next door, CF63, which covers
OL,8,FBarry, including Cadoxton and Barry
OL,9,FDocks, the average house price was
OL,10,F#260,234 ` #82,519 less.
OL,12,FIn Northern Ireland, the BT4 postcode
OL,13,Fcovering East Belfast had an average
OL,14,Fhouse price of #278,143.
OL,16,FIn nearby BT16, the average house
OL,17,Fprice was #247,068 ` #31,075 less
OL,18,Fcompared with BT4.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/16
