OL,3,CStudy indicates how much home buyers
OL,4,Ccould save by picking less pricey
OL,5,Cpostcodes
OL,7,FThe analysis was based on the same
OL,8,Fmortgage approval data used to
OL,9,Fcalculate the long-running Lloyds
OL,10,Fhouse price index. House price figures
OL,11,Frelate to sales completed in 2025.
OL,13,FFor London, prime central locations
OL,14,Fwere excluded from the research due to
OL,15,Fbeing small, highly localised areas.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/16
